      "writtenOn": "2021-04-13T17:32:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The point with panics is that they shouldn\u0027t normally be tested (other than that they _don\u0027t_ happen) - they\u0027re e assertions after all, and I think that applies to these too.\n\nPanics give much better debug info since they have stack traces.",
